Hello fellow gamers,
we wanted to let you know that the work on the Act II is proceeding as expected.

Moreover, we take the opportunity to give you a preview on the updates for the Act II:
- A complete revision of the alchemy and eco-engine minigames (Act I will be affected too);
- 19 new game areas (including a second secret room);
- 26 new characters;
- Act II will last twice the duration than Act I

We hope to show you some screenshots of the work in progress as soon as we can.

Cheers and keep having fun!

